Defects found.

- Shape: instrument reads a name, not its binding. Line 114. Input: `export({"outcomes":[{"id":"o","direction_of_benefit":"harm","declared_class":"x"}],"results":{"by_outcome":{"o":{"per_trial":[{"trial_id":"T1","log_point":0.0,"log_se":0.1,"measure":"HR"}]}}}})[0]["pools"][0]["entries"][0]`. Consequence: exported `direction_of_benefit` is `"efficacy"`, replacing the object’s recorded `"harm"`.

- Shape: selector keyed to too-narrow form. Line 160. Input: same pool shape with `"pooled":{"point":0.5,"scale":"LOG"}`. Consequence: `pooled_estimate` exports as `0.5` instead of `log(0.5)`, so pooled and per-trial estimates are on different scales.

- Shape: zero conflated with absent. Line 350. Input: `export({"app_id":"x"}, page_html="")`. Consequence: an existing empty page is treated as “no page HTML given”, so page-scoped sentinel/unicode-minus checks are not emitted.

- Shape: negation dropped. Line 355. Input: `export({"app_id":"x"}, page_html="&minus; 1.25")[0]["numeric_fields"][0]["naive_value"]`. Consequence: the negative value exports as positive `1.25`, masking sign loss.

- Shape: selector keyed to a form the page need not use. Line 356. Input: `export({"app_id":"x"}, page_html="− 1.25")[0].get("numeric_fields")`. Consequence: literal Unicode minus creates no numeric payload, so the unicode-minus marker cannot fire.

- Shape: check cannot fail. Line 505. Input: CLI `python scripts/export_artefact.py obj.json --page missing.html`. Consequence: a requested missing page is silently treated as absent; if object payloads exist, page checks are skipped without a page-specific non-zero exit.

No proven hit in this file for: probe keyed to the string a fix removes; idempotency guard satisfied by its own comment/marker; CRLF/LF text comparison; merged-cell/off-by-one tabulation.
